Subject: [PATCH 10/10] tracking: reference-clip motion tracking env (course project
 S3.1-S3.5)

One clip per episode from a clip library (CURATION_LIBRARY, CURATION_CLIPS); 152-dim deployable actor
observation with reference preview; privileged critic; bounded Gaussian tracking rewards with no
command gating; reference-state initialisation; name-based DR with +-1 cm CoM and floor surfaces.
